prop rocketrack obj.name=rocketrack
prop rocketrack beh.use=Light the fuse of the finale
prop rocketrack if.use=quest|9\n!signal|finale
prop rocketrack on.use=message||The fuse fizzes along the rack and up the stage's roof - and the sky over Lanternfall breaks open in gold and red and green. Lights run along every string from the stage to the pier. On the rack, where the rockets stood, a paper fan.\nsignal||finale\nshow|fireworks\nshow|festlights\nshow|finaleglow\nshow|finalemusic\nsound||event:/weapons/firework/launch\nwait|2\nsound||event:/weapons/firework/explode\nwait|2\nsound||event:/weapons/firework/explode\ngive||story:fan*1
prop rocketrack else.use=message||The finale's fuse. The programme says: when all twelve lanterns burn.
